# =====================================================================
# SOSIES - .gitignore for the Unreal Engine project
#
# This file lives in Sosies/:
#   "/Name"  = only at the top level of Sosies/
#   "Name/"  = a folder with that name anywhere inside Sosies/
# =====================================================================

# ---- Folders Unreal regenerates by itself (never commit) --------------
# Note: if we ever add a precompiled plugin to Sosies/Plugins (e.g. DLSS),
# add an exception such as  !Plugins/<PluginName>/Binaries/
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# ---- IDE / project files generated from the .uproject -----------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
*.code-workspace
compile_commands.json

# ---- Build folder: keep only hand-made platform files -----------------
# (Unreal writes generated files here; icons and pak lists are ours.
#  Revisit at M13 when we set up the Steam build.)
/Build/*
!/Build/*/
/Build/*/**
!/Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt
!/Build/**/*.ico

# ---- Packaged builds (package OUTSIDE the repo; this is a safety net) -
/Packaged/

# ---- Compiled code objects (C++ later; normally inside Intermediate/) --
# (*.obj is deliberately NOT listed: it is also a 3D model format.)
*.o
*.pch
*.gch

# ---- OS and tool clutter -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
*.blend1
*.blend2

# ---- Licensed third-party content: NOT allowed in a public repository ----
# ziv189/App is public (the owner's choice, see Docs/Decisions.md D-003).
# Fab's Standard License only allows sharing source assets privately
# (with collaborators or through a private repository), so the default
# Fab / Megascans import folders stay out of Git and get their own backup.
# MetaHuman output gets the same protection until we review its licence
# at M3. If the repository is ever made private, delete this block.
# See Docs/Decisions.md D-004.
/Content/Fab/
/Content/Megascans/
/Content/MSPresets/
/Content/MetaHumans/
